{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hexalith Demo</strong> offers a first taste of our glowing sci-fi city-builder. In this demo, you\u2019ll play through the early phase of a run, try different starting blueprints, and experiment with resource and city tile placement as you push for the highest score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s included in the demo</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin your run by choosing from <strong>3 unique starting blueprints</strong>, each with its own resource multiplier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place and combine a <strong>set of resource and city tiles</strong> to discover adjacency bonuses and strategic layouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the <strong>first main mission</strong> and several optional side missions to test your planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>shop system</strong> to purchase or refresh a smaller pool of blueprints every few turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience at least one <strong>world event</strong>, which introduces penalties that challenge your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong> and compare your score with other demo players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo showcases <strong>early progression, core mechanics, and scoring systems</strong> of Hexalith.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional city-tiles, more world events, extended mission chains, and advanced strategies  will be available in the full version.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"You Made It!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4078440/61ab9e76d5e22e7fbfbec1994cb2a4f7acc300e4.jpg"},{"name":"Complete the main mission","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/407844